(7740607, 1276769, 83313, '<td valign="top">There appears to be some minor but visible curvature from lens distortion. Other than that bothering me, this is a pleasing and interesting shot. Would make a nice desktop background.</td>', 'There appears to be some minor but visible curvature from lens distortion. Other than that bothering me, this is a pleasing and interesting shot. Would make a nice desktop background.', '2023-03-22 01:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
