(7741193, 1276750, 83313, '<td valign="top">Feedback per your recent request: I gave this a 6, mostly for the interesting macro shot and fitting the topic quite literally. But it came off to me as soft and the colors are odd. I see a very slow shutter speed. I can sometimes manage a slow speed like that with my Olympus, but it is iffy and often wont allow for any cropping.</td>', 'Feedback per your recent request: I gave this a 6, mostly for the interesting macro shot and fitting the topic quite literally. But it came off to me as soft and the colors are odd. I see a very slow shutter speed. I can sometimes manage a slow speed like that with my Olympus, but it is iffy and often wont allow for any cropping.', '2023-03-31 03:11:01.000000', NULL, 0),
